## AutoLevelingModal.tsx
@flow-hash: b59b8e6c

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant M as AutoLevelingModal
    participant E as Engine (useAutoLeveling)
    participant I as IndexedDB (cached maps)
    participant R as Remote API
    participant L as localStorage
    participant S as SavedTargets

    U->>M: Open modal
    M->>M: Load config from localStorage
    M->>I: Fetch continent names (cached)
    M->>R: Fetch continent names (remote)
    M->>I: Fetch area names (cached)
    M->>R: Fetch area names (remote)
    M->>I: Fetch beasts (cached)
    M->>R: Fetch beasts (remote)
    M->>R: Fetch training paths (by areaId)
    M->>S: Load manual targets for area
    M->>L: Load user paths

    U->>M: Select continent
    M->>M: Fetch area names for continent
    U->>M: Select area
    M->>M: Load manual targets for area
    M->>M: Fetch beasts for area
    M->>M: Fetch training paths for area

    U->>M: Edit steps in Configure tab
    M->>M: Parse textarea to actions
    M->>L: Save config to localStorage

    U->>M: Click Start
    M->>E: Call start() with saved config
    E->>E: Begin autoleveling run
    E->>R: Send engagement commands
    E->>R: Handle fight sequence
    E->>R: Wait for round completion
    E->>E: Loop if loopRounds=true

    U->>M: Click Build tab
    M->>M: Load user paths
    M->>M: Parse Mudlet script
    M->>M: Convert to build steps
    M->>M: Save steps to draft
    M->>L: Save user path to localStorage

    U->>M: Click Save
    M->>L: Save config to localStorage
    M->>L: Save user paths to localStorage
```

Caption: Interaction flow.

## ContributeCreatureLoreModal.tsx
@flow-hash: 0fd194ac

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ContributeCreatureLoreModal
    participant EventDispatcher
    participant WebServer
    participant MapsAPI
    participant Database

    User->>ContributeCreatureLoreModal: Opens modal
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>EventDispatcher: Listen for 'shatteredarchive:identity-updated'
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>EventDispatcher: Listen for 'shatteredarchive:raw-data'
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>MapsAPI: Fetch continent names
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>MapsAPI: Fetch area names per continent
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>WebServer: POST /contribute/creaturelore (on submit)

    loop Capture sequence
        ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>EventDispatcher: Dispatch 'shatteredarchive:send-command' (creaturelore)
        EventDispatcher->>ContributeCreatureLoreModal: Receive 'shatteredarchive:raw-data' (lore lines)
        ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>EventDispatcher: Dispatch 'shatteredarchive:send-command' (look)
        EventDispatcher->>ContributeCreatureLoreModal: Receive 'shatteredarchive:raw-data' (look lines)
    end

    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>Database: Store submitted creature lore/look data
    WebServer->>Database: Save data
    ContributeCreatureLoreModal->>User: Show success or error message
```

Caption: The modal captures creature lore and look data through user commands, fetches map metadata, and submits the data to a backend database.

## ContributeIdentifyModal.tsx
@flow-hash: 0102d2e1

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ContributeIdentifyModal
    participant EventEmitter
    participant GameClient
    participant WebServer

    User->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Opens modal
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>EventEmitter: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:identity-updated')
    GameClient->>EventEmitter: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:identity-updated')
    EventEmitter->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Notify identity update
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>EventEmitter: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:raw-data')
    User->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Clicks 'Identify'
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>GameClient: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:send-command')
    GameClient->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Capture raw data
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>EventEmitter: Stop listening after 1s
    User->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Fills form, clicks 'Submit'
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>WebServer: POST /contribute/identify
    WebServer->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Response (success/failure)
    ContributeIdentifyModal->>User: Show success/error message
```

Caption: Interaction flow.

## MainMenuBar.tsx
@flow-hash: 8e2ce8ed

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant MainMenuBar
    participant useMainMenuBar
    participant GraphicsSettingsModal
    participant AudioSettingsModal
    participant AccessibilitySettingsModal
    participant ExternalLinks

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click menu item
    MainMenuBar->>useMainMenuBar: toggleRootMenu()
    useMainMenuBar-->>MainMenuBar: Update state
    MainMenuBar->>User: Render submenu

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click submenu item
    MainMenuBar->>useMainMenuBar: toggleGameSettings()
    useMainMenuBar-->>MainMenuBar: Update state
    MainMenuBar->>User: Render nested submenu

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click Settings > Audio…
    MainMenuBar->>useMainMenuBar: openAudioModal()
    useMainMenuBar-->>MainMenuBar: Update state
    MainMenuBar->>AudioSettingsModal: Render modal

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click Settings > Accessibility…
    MainMenuBar->>useMainMenuBar: openAccessibilityModal()
    useMainMenuBar-->>MainMenuBar: Update state
    MainMenuBar->>AccessibilitySettingsModal: Render modal

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click File > Connect…
    MainMenuBar->>MainMenuBar: Call onOpenConnect()

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click Game > Script Sandbox…
    MainMenuBar->>MainMenuBar: Call onOpenScriptSandbox()

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click External > Open Shattered Archive
    MainMenuBar->>ExternalLinks: Open URL in new tab

    User->>MainMenuBar: Click Help > Scripting…
    MainMenuBar->>MainMenuBar: Call onOpenScriptingHelp()
```

Caption: The MainMenuBar component handles user interactions to open submenus and modals, delegating actions to external handlers and rendering settings modals based on user selections.

## PluginsModal.tsx
@flow-hash: a06fa3d7

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant PluginsModal
    participant usePlugins
    participant pluginHost
    participant UserStyleOverrideModal
    participant PluginConfigModal

    User->>PluginsModal: Open modal
    PluginsModal->>usePlugins: Initialize hooks
    usePlugins->>PluginsModal: Return plugin state

    loop For each core plugin
        PluginsModal->>PluginsModal: Render plugin row
        PluginsModal->>usePlugins: Check install status
        PluginsModal->>usePlugins: Get install record
    end

    PluginsModal->>User: Display plugin list

    User->>PluginsModal: Click Install
    PluginsModal->>usePlugins: installCorePlugin()
    usePlugins->>pluginHost: Enable plugin

    User->>PluginsModal: Toggle plugin enabled
    PluginsModal->>usePlugins: setPluginEnabled()
    usePlugins->>pluginHost: Enable/Disable plugin

    User->>PluginsModal: Click Configure
    PluginsModal->>usePlugins: installCorePlugin() (if needed)
    PluginsModal->>PluginConfigModal: Open config modal

    User->>PluginsModal: Click CSS
    PluginsModal->>UserStyleOverrideModal: Open CSS modal

    User->>PluginsModal: Click Export
    PluginsModal->>PluginsModal: Export plugin data

    User->>PluginsModal: Click Remove
    PluginsModal->>usePlugins: removePlugin()
    usePlugins->>pluginHost: Disable plugin
```

Caption: The PluginsModal manages plugin installation, configuration, and enabling/disabling, coordinating with hooks, the plugin host, and child modals for CSS and config.

