```

Caption: The RightSidebar component orchestrates UI rendering and state management for game status, vitals, and enemy information, interacting with hooks, local storage, and event emitters.

## UserScriptSandboxModal.tsx
@flow-hash: dbf9ae4a

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UserScriptSandboxModal
    participant useUserScriptSandbox
    participant getUserScriptStorageKey
    participant ImportExportModal
    participant localStorage
    participant FileReader
    participant downloadJson
    participant buildTriggerTree
    participant filterScriptsByTagQuery

    User->>UserScriptSandboxModal: Open modal
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>useUserScriptSandbox: Fetch scripts for connectionId
    useUserScriptSandbox->>localStorage: Read user scripts from storage
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>getUserScriptStorageKey: Generate storage key
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>buildTriggerTree: Build trigger tree for display
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>filterScriptsByTagQuery: Filter scripts by search query

    User->>UserScriptSandboxModal: Click Export
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>ImportExportModal: Show export modal
    ImportExportModal->>ImportExportModal: Filter and select scripts
    ImportExportModal->>ImportExportModal: Build export JSON
    ImportExportModal->>downloadJson: Download export file

    User->>UserScriptSandboxModal: Click Import
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>ImportExportModal: Show import modal
    ImportExportModal->>FileReader: Read import file
    ImportExportModal->>ImportExportModal: Parse JSON and validate
    ImportExportModal->>ImportExportModal: Show parsed items for selection
    ImportExportModal->>useUserScriptSandbox: Merge/replace scripts
    useUserScriptSandbox->>localStorage: Update storage with new scripts

    User->>UserScriptSandboxModal: Edit script
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>useUserScriptSandbox: Update script in state
    useUserScriptSandbox->>localStorage: Persist script changes

    User->>UserScriptSandboxModal: Test script
    UserScriptSandboxModal->>useUserScriptSandbox: Run script with test data
    useUserScriptSandbox->>ROUTED_WINDOW_EVENTS: Dispatch test event
```

Caption: The UserScriptSandboxModal orchestrates user script management, including editing, testing, and importing/exporting scripts through localStorage, with real-time updates and validation.
